## Upstream Concat Authors & Contributors
ClipCat is an independent derivative work based on Concat. The following upstream authors contributed to the foundation and engine:
- Jareer Abdullah <jareer@example.com>
- Concat Contributors (see Git provenance and upstream history)

## Third-Party Components & Libraries
