- FFmpeg Project Developers
- whisper.cpp Developers (Georgi Gerganov and contributors)
- ONNX Runtime Developers (Microsoft Corporation)
- Hanken Grotesk Font (Hanken Design Co., Alfredo Marco Pradil)
